For a mode-line in your XF86Config file, the components are as follows:

#  82.08kHz, 65.93 Hz
Modeline "1600x1200"    175     1600 1660 1876 2132     1200 1208 1211 1245

                        ^ DotClock
                                ^ HDisplay
                                     ^ HSyncStart
                                          ^ HSyncEnd
                                               ^ HTotal
                                                        ^ VDisplay
                                                             ^ VSyncStart
                                                                  ^ VSyncEnd
                                                                       ^ VTotal

optionally followed by some flags like "+HSync" "Interlace" etc.

You can easily experiment with these using 'xvidtune'.

Bye,
  Rob.



