in changing this. It is'nt my code and it works on almost every
other machine except alpha linux. I just want to get it to work.

I am aware that malloc returns a long int pointer and that long
int is 8 bytes on alpha linux, while it is 4 bytes on PC Linux.

The code below isolates the problem from the main program. It
seems to give exactly the results I get from the main program.
I have tried to force everything that should be IINTEGER*8 to be
so, even to making the functions external so I can declare them.

