Hello,
  After much trial and error I finally got Linux/intel 4.08 to run on my
alpha box.
1) install em86 0.4
2) create a directory with netscape 4.08 in it.
3) make sure you can move netscape to another name.
4) use the follwoing command to run it.
          (./netscape &);sleep 1; mv netscape netscape.save
5) enjoy 4.08 on your computer.
6) I haven't tried 4.5 yet , Someone let me know please.

Thanks
Leslie Donaldson

